    {
      "id": "decided",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 296,
      "w": 604,
      "h": 162,
      "text": "• A full run takes about 15 minutes, with a goal that ends it.\n• Score: points for every hit, plus bonuses for dungeons, lives left and the dragon.\n• High scores and unlocks carry over; power doesn’t.\n• The main table is 1 of 2–3 hand-made layouts per run.",
      "size": 18,
      "color": "#1f1b16"
    },
    {
